ri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312373_1363239738226092_2106854729412937022_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DkJDi6NE6WgQ7kNvwGSbCa9&_nc_oc=AdoNPWCjDzbF1qixBWHWj3y1gyZSalY87V_rYYLU01sodzyXIGJWREw0P4ZnLV3pa7o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFiqu0QVAusD1LuiBefU78Bi24Hu_1evXuIR6vB9mOuFQ&oe=6A8D876E"}, {"file_name": "ChallengeMode_Image_02.png", "id": "1188201992987967", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499295509_1188201996321300_2111120103698102006_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oATM-PG7en4Q7kNvwGxRKhv&_nc_oc=Adqy3Z7c4LP0By12ZRyRAsJyVpPhO5JTQw_RtLQBjkntxZZEN7mSuicgYG1Hgr1yyxU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHwk5LWIaPhhCZiP5pqL_AMPUJzBDq9rNzCJj09HmPniQ&oe=6A8D7BCA"}, {"file_name": "Cosmetics_Image_02.png", "id": "1737987487068873", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499295801_1737987493735539_1039395962667216685_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8ZXUqKbZB0MQ7kNvwH2xThC&_nc_oc=AdqkL9YEqcz1rM51Dbs2tm-fC2RerGmQ3RHw4mhfAWzr8xJrtLWKUzvxKEjmfr254tE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHmJujFUQfzqlD8JadFLLHHYdEK7mQWjaXn_TnWwtlWCw&oe=6A8D6AEB"}, {"file_name": "DodgeLasers_02.png", "id": "3637904013182167", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499294007_3637904023182166_4032639804070807573_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ni49ooCG74MQ7kNvwHZM5o5&_nc_oc=Adr-2o9kzHZP_PsMYpI9IQev9K4DzagECBr4EUicE7LdicAL_5H-aT5nRdCnZ3uKGb8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEEz98hKpOTwwc6HvZb2_3mel1bCTnCi_XITeM0ZTYloQ&oe=6A8D9031"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "CoverArt_Landscape_New.png", "id": "898823102474350", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499299808_898823109141016_4587002048357409884_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VL0escO4no4Q7kNvwHa0qnc&_nc_oc=AdqIBXmCUvXk1ZxYxJafd5_5v7sx6Z-3yW3THOKpJW9bpeRWTkpY1zVV8h80vZvBkXA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHF7_RgUAV3Kv-5Oxs7AkgmvfnN05oGVeimuTiOMA9U0w&oe=6A8D8FF8"}, "display_name": "Punch Bomb", "keywords": ["Punch", "Arcade", "Bomb", "Game", "Challenge"], "long_description": "# Punch Bomb\nis a fast-paced 360\u00b0 action arcade game where you punch bombs away before they explode.\n\nBuilt for those who love a challenge.\n\nClimb the global leaderboards across 3 punchable game modes!\n\n\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\n\n# Classic Mode\nSurvive as long as you can! Punch a variety of bombs away from you before they explode, dodge dangerous laser obstacles, hit targets, and rack up huge combos.\n{4009259875886708}\n\n\n\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\n\n# Blitz Mode\n\nRace against the clock to get a high score within the time limit! Bombs no longer explode, and targets extend your time. \n{1063827595628759}\n\n\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\n\n# Challenge Mode\nComplete a fun collection of challenges that put your speed and accuracy to the test!\n{1207719874395696}\n\n\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\n\n# Unique Cosmetics\nUnlock unique cosmetics by **playing the game** and mastering its challenges. Each cosmetic has its own visual flair!\n\n\n\n\n{1198946195348915}", "short_description": "Punch bombs away from you before they explode while racking up combos, dodging dangerous laser obstacles, and hitting targets! Compete in global leaderboards across 3 punchable game modes!"}]}, "developer_name": nul